  "text": "AFK Kree'arra (Hard Mode)\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\n⬥ Stand in the doorway, do not move upon entering the instance.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• With Necromancy you may position yourself anywhere.\n​\nMagic AFK Method (55+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Essence of Finality \n⬥ Scripture of Wen \n    • Can replace with scrimshaw of the elements \n⬥ 3 pieces of cryptbloom armour \nAbilities\n⬥ Greater Concentrated Blast \n⬥ Greater Chain \n⬥ Greater Sunshine \nOther\n⬥ Exsanguinate \n⬥ Animate Dead \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ Due to the completely random nature of the mechanics even with everything, you can have rare instances of dying.\n​\nPresets and Relics \n​\n⬥ Magic preset \n​\n\nAction Bars \n\n​\nExample Kills \n⬥ Magic example\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Kree'arra (Hard Mode) ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning ⬥ Stand in the doorway, do not move upon entering the instance. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• With Necromancy you may position yourself anywhere. ​ Magic AFK Method (55+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ Essence of Finality ⬥ Scripture of Wen • Can replace with scrimshaw of the elements ⬥ 3 pieces of cryptbloom armour Abilities ⬥ Greater Concentrated Blast ⬥ Greater Chain ⬥ Greater Sunshine Other ⬥ Exsanguinate ⬥ Animate Dead ⬥ Due to the completely random nature of the mechanics even with everything, you can have rare instances of dying. ​ Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ Magic preset ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ Magic example ​",
